# Invisible Woman, Sue Storm: "Whenever you put one or more +1/+1 counters on one or more other Heroes you control" - one trigger for
# counters put on several Heroes at once (CR 603.2c). On turn 5 Agent Phil Coulson taps to put a +1/+1 counter on each other Hero Bot1
# controls: Invisible Woman herself and both Masked Meowers. The two Meowers are other Heroes, and together they trigger it once, so
# Bot1 may create a single Wall (it accepts), not two; Invisible Woman's own counter is not "other".

